msgid "You fell from the saddle."
msgstr "Vous êtes tombé de cheval."

msgid "The bot fell from the saddle."
msgstr "Le bot est tombé de cheval."

msgid "You must feed your horse."
msgstr "Vous devez nourrir votre cheval."

